  "title": "Chef John's Peach Tartlets",
  "description": "Use your own pastry or pick up a box at the store for these quick and easy peach tartlets. Chinese five-spice powder brings out the flavors of the fruit.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:58:51-04:00",
